From: SupraCraft qualification work
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] viewer: admit exact Java 26.3 render assets

Keep version admission explicit: once exact 26.3 atlas/blockstate artifacts are
generated locally, Prismarine Viewer should select them rather than snapping to
another 26.x presentation version.

This patch is intentionally limited to the supported-version table. Asset
generation and exact-version qualification remain separate concerns.

